editor_description = "Raid Dap Thuy Trieu (red): locked raid in three tide lanes (west, north, east). Each lane has a sluice lever (TideLever) that floods it at once; the surge stuns every enemy in the lane. Three scripted waves fill the lanes. Clearing it opens both piers and spawns the raid chest."

